WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,490 --> 00:00:05,200
boss

2
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:08,330
There seems to be a commotion outside. Who cares what happened?

3
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:14,230
You just need to take good care of me. As for the rest, you don’t have to worry about my brothers.

4
00:00:14,510 --> 00:00:15,550
This kind of violence will happen in the future

5
00:00:15,630 --> 00:00:16,950
It's just us who have the final say

6
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:22,530
Come on, come on, come on, come on, where is Wang Sheng?

7
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:23,970
He probably ran away home

8
00:00:24,570 --> 00:00:25,490
Want me to say

9
00:00:25,690 --> 00:00:27,050
Let's start from today

10
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:29,770
Just pry open the doors one by one.

11
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:31,650
All the food found

12
00:00:31,850 --> 00:00:33,090
We centralize management

13
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:34,330
Distribute equally

14
00:00:35,050 --> 00:00:36,650
Since Wang Sheng dares to escape,

15
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:39,980
Then he has no part in it, Brother Zhu

16
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:41,620
I'm afraid you don't know

17
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:43,260
Wang Sheng's wife

18
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,140
Don't think about anything else first

19
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:46,820
First, focus on getting food

20
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:48,620
Wait until we are full

21
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:50,940
All the furniture was approved for heating by fire.

22
00:00:51,490 --> 00:00:53,010
People will come by then
